WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.190
Parcel map.

2
00:00:01.190 --> 00:00:05.638
See plot boundaries with their dag and khatian numbers.

3
00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:08.146
Owner names are not shown here.

4
00:00:09.098 --> 00:00:09.672
Step 1.

5
00:00:09.672 --> 00:00:10.738
Open the map.

6
00:00:10.738 --> 00:00:13.936
Open Parcel map from the Services menu.

7
00:00:13.936 --> 00:00:16.560
You see the whole of Bangladesh.

8
00:00:17.515 --> 00:00:18.110
Step 2.

9
00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:19.471
Go to your area.

10
00:00:19.471 --> 00:00:21.427
Press Show search menu.

11
00:00:21.427 --> 00:00:24.829
Pick the division, district and upazila.

12
00:00:24.829 --> 00:00:27.125
The map moves to that area.

13
00:00:28.082 --> 00:00:28.617
Step 3.

14
00:00:28.617 --> 00:00:29.611
See the plot.

15
00:00:29.611 --> 00:00:33.588
In the parcel list below the map, press Show on map.

16
00:00:33.588 --> 00:00:37.182
A small card shows the dag and khatian numbers.
